With a page and its other language side by side, the sidebar belongs to the page last clicked or typed in, Tab between them included. A page re-showing its selection, as it does on a scroll or resize, or the other language following the selected block, no longer takes the sidebar a moment after a click in the other page. The bridge reports the author's keys (`AUTHOR_KEY`) as well as presses, and no longer guesses from timing whether a selection was the author's (`userInput` is gone).
